{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-130",
  "title": "Form Template (LOI)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Form Template (LOI)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Using Tally.so for LOI Collection – Best Approach & Form Structure**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Yes, a completed form can count as a Letter of Intent (LOI).**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**It does NOT need to be a formal signed document** (e.g., PDF with a wet signature)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**As long as it includes the necessary intent statements & a name/title/organization, it holds weight**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**A Tally.so form is ideal** because it:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Removes friction** (takes <2 minutes to complete)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Automates tracking** (no manual follow-ups for signatures)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- *Lets you easily share & embed it across email, Slack, LinkedIn, etc.)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Tally.so Form Structure (Minimal, Effective LOI Format)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Suggested Fields:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Intro Text (Brief, Clear, Non-Binding)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Header:** *Letter of Intent – Docket.tv Pilot Participation*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"This form serves as a non-binding Letter of Intent (LOI) for stations interested in exploring a potential pilot of Docket.tv, a modern scheduling & engagement tool built for PEG stations.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"By completing this form, you are indicating that your organization is interested in learning more and participating in early-stage discussions. This is NOT a contractual commitment—just a way to show interest and support Docket.tv's development.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Basic Organization Info**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Full Name** *(text field)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Title/Role** *(text field)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Organization/PEG Station Name** *(text field)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**City & State** *(text field)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Interest & Commitment Level**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Would you be interested in piloting Docket.tv?** *(single-choice select)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yes, we’d like to explore a pilot program"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Possibly—need more details first"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No, but we support the project"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**What are your station’s biggest scheduling pain points?** *(multi-select checkboxes)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Outdated or difficult scheduling system"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Manual workflows / lack of automation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No remote access / scheduling requires on-site staff"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Integration issues with website, streaming, or playout systems"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "High costs / lack of budget-friendly solutions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Other: *(open text field for custom response)*"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Would you be open to providing feedback during the pilot phase?** *(yes/no toggle button)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Signature & Confirmation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Confirmation Statement (Checkbox):**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*“I confirm that [Organization Name] is interested in exploring a potential pilot of Docket.tv and supports its development for PEG stations. I understand that this is non-binding and does not commit us to implementation.”*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**E-Signature (Full Name Entry Box)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Date** *(auto-filled or user selects)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Optional (Boosts Credibility)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*“Would you be open to providing a brief testimonial about why a tool like Docket.tv is needed in PEG?”* *(open text box, optional but useful for grant applications!)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Why This Works**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Super fast to complete (~2 mins).**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Collects structured data on pain points** (helpful for grant writing + product development)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Includes a clear intent statement & e-signature** → functionally equivalent to a formal LOI."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Works better than PDFs or email attachments** (easy for busy station managers)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easy to track & follow up on submissions.**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Next Steps to Implement**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Build the form on Tally.so** using the structure above."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Set up automatic confirmation emails** (so stations get a copy of their submission)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Embed the form link in Rebecca’s outreach emails.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Use a live dashboard (Airtable/Notion/Google Sheet) to track responses.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Start outreach with warm leads first, then expand.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Bonus: Shareable Tracking Link**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Create a **public view-only summary page** (via Google Sheets or Notion) that auto-updates with **how many stations have signed LOIs**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When reaching out to new stations, Rebecca can **mention the growing list** (“We already have 5 stations interested, including XYZ PEG center”)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This **creates social proof** and makes others more likely to say **“yes”**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Final Verdict:** **YES, use Tally.so for LOI collection.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**No friction, fast execution, and easy tracking.**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**It holds the same credibility as a formal document.**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Rebecca can share the link easily & track progress in real time.**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}